          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಲೆದಾಡು — aledāḍu — \"to wander; to roam\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಳೆದುಹೋದ ಹುಡುಗ ಇಡೀ ರಾತ್ರಿ ಕಾಡಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಅಲೆದಾಡಿದನು. kaḷeduhōda huḍuga iḍī rātri kāḍinalli aledāḍidanu. The lost boy wandered in the forest all night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಅಲೆದಾಡಿದೆ, aledāḍide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To move about with no fixed path. ಸುತ್ತಾಡು is to stroll around for pleasure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಲೆದಾಡು (aledāḍu) is a native Dravidian compound: ale, \"to move about, to wander\" (DEDR 240), and āḍu, \"to move, to act\" (DEDR 347)."
            }
          ]
        },
